# Cursor Rule: Themis Shared AI Layer

- **Shared State Directory:** `.agents/`
- **Core Guidelines:** Follow Clean Architecture, S.O.L.I.D., and Clean Code standards located in `.agents/rules/`.
- **UI & Aesthetics:** Adhere to `impeccable` design guardrails and `web-design-guidelines`. Avoid generic AI styling.
- **State Separation:** Server state belongs exclusively in TanStack Query; UI state belongs in Zustand feature slices; route filters belong in URL params.
- **Skills:** Loaded directly from `.agents/skills/`.
- **Coordination:** Respect task locks in `.agents/tasks/locks/`.
